@* A Template cell whose fragment is a component (CoreGrid, Templates="true"): the case ADR-0350
   section 15 names, a Blazor component inside the grid's DOM. Its value is a decimal, which Blazor
   compares itself, so it renders only when its row hands it another value. *@
<span class="@(Value < 0 ? "core-neg" : "core-pos")">@CoreData.Format(Value)</span>

@code {
    [Parameter] public decimal Value { get; set; }
}
